"""Eighty explicit n-independent strict d2 overlap states and actual descents.

State (top,bottom,k,c,y), depth, proper-prefix top index, bottom index,
destination-row index. The entire proof is checked in
psc.class_a_d2_fixed_corridor, not assumed from this fixed data. All
nonterminal witnesses have sum(w)=0, so M_n*w is independent of n.
These are candidate physical overlaps, not uniformly seed-reachable states.
"""

